	(descr "DEUTSCH DT series 12-way VERTICAL (180 deg) sealed PCB receptacle with panel flange, DT15-12PA (key A, grey) / DT15-12PB (key B, black) / -12PC / -12PD - dimensionally identical, only key + colour differ. Hand-derived from TE customer drawing C-DT15-12PX rev D2 sheet 1 (rear/PCB view mirrored to the mating-face view, key end at -y, PIN 1 bottom-left). Pins 12x dia 1.57+/-0.05 on two columns x=+/-4.56 (12X .180 from centre), rows y=+/-2.22, +/-6.67, +/-11.11 (4.445 pitch); drill 2.0 / pad 2.8. Four #4-20 Plastite screws from the board UNDERSIDE into dia 2.79 blind holes 8.0 deep at (+/-10.67, +/-17.54) (4X .420 / 4X .691) - NPTH 3.5 in the PCB, dia 6.6 bosses on the connector face, screw heads on B.Cu (B.CrtYd circles). Body/flange outline 35.26 x 59.21 sits on the board; flange face 15.52 above the PCB, mating shroud to 30.12, pins protrude 3.10 below; panel cutout + 2x dia 3.10 #6-19 holes on 40.56 for through-panel mounting (sheet 2). Mates DT06-12SX plug (X = key) + W12S wedgelock, size-16 contacts 13 A. TE 'Amostras disponiveis' 2026-09-23: -12PA yes, -12PB/PC/PD no.")
